    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d6a41c24a6b755f033f3049abb090e73.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL LETTER FROM CUBIVERSITY ADMISSIONS!\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc8c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your 15 charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.poster.avif?t=1755219807\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.webm?t=1755219807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.mp4?t=1755219807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d2bbb70d31eca8fadceea8c15289ad51.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance by elimination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 5 students for your project group, and end up with your soulmate at the end of the week!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular dialogue based on the group you pick, the locations you go to, and many other variables, makes sure no two runs  are ever the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make leads to a different ending. But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a single wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love comes in many forms, and Love Craft makes room for all of them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/a3f376ba8886f374f0a2256a0fc57fa3.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to having you join us next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours sincerely, <br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d6a41c24a6b755f033f3049abb090e73.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL LETTER FROM CUBIVERSITY ADMISSIONS!\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc8c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your 15 charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.poster.avif?t=1755219807\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.webm?t=1755219807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/051d800d82e49d8085313bdf348908ef.mp4?t=1755219807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d2bbb70d31eca8fadceea8c15289ad51.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance by elimination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 5 students for your project group, and end up with your soulmate at the end of the week!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular dialogue based on the group you pick, the locations you go to, and many other variables, makes sure no two runs  are ever the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make leads to a different ending. But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a single wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love comes in many forms, and Love Craft makes room for all of them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/a3f376ba8886f374f0a2256a0fc57fa3.avif?t=1755219807\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to having you join us next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours sincerely, <br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>",
    "short_description": "Join the Crafting Club, where the glue is strong and the feelings stronger! Craft chaos, flirt fearlessly, and make some very bad romantic decisions! Find your project partner in this elimination-based Dating Sim!",
